  "description": "## 👋 WELCOME TO IDLE LEGION\n\n### ⚠️ ATTENTION, PLEASE\n- Beginners are welcome!\n\n### 💬 OUR DISCORD - https://discord.gg/Yr8kRUxtAm\n- Active guild with daily events\n- Announcements, strategies and discussions happen on Discord\n\n**IMPORTANT:** All official guild communication is handled on Discord.\n\n### 📜 RULES\n- **Guild challenges:** mandatory  \n  3 days inactive = removal\n- **Guild stockpile:** mandatory  \n  3 days inactive = removal\n\nNote: Activity is checked whenever possible.\n\n### 👺 EVENT TIMES\n\n\n### 🗡️ Energizing Pool\n- **GMT-3 (BR):** 12:00\n- **GMT+2 (EU):** 17:00\n\n### ⚔️ ASSAULT\n- **12:00 (GMT-3 BR)**\n- **17:00 (GMT+2 EU)**\n- Two assaults per week (weekends)\n- Each assault lasts **9 hours**\n- Map: **ELDORIA**\n\n### 🪓 STOCKPILE LIST\nRepair the pool:\n- 7,500 Iron Bar (Stockpile: 3,000)\n- 7,500 Mercury Bar (Stockpile: 2,883)\n- 7,500 Uranium Bar (Stockpile: 3,054)",
